flow "Ship with confidence"
node Start shape=terminal label="Ready for review"
node Tests shape=box label="Run checks" sublabel="Tests, lint, package"
node Approved shape=decision label="Checks pass?"
node Ship shape=terminal label="Publish release"
node Fix label="Resolve failures"
Start -> Tests -> Approved
Approved => Ship: yes
Approved -> Fix: no
Fix -> Tests: retry
highlight Ship
